# Pin LF for every text file. Windows Git defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which otherwise rewrites working-tree bytes to CRLF. That breaks:
#   - SHA-256 checks on the five hash-pinned patch files
#   - Linux shebangs (container/start.sh -> /usr/bin/env bash^M)
#   - Docker COPY of those scripts into the XPU image
#
# PowerShell 5.1/7 run LF scripts. Do not mark *.ps1 as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.whl binary
*.safetensors binary
